@url=https://global.americanexpress.com/api/servicing/v1


### Get statement CSV
GET {{ url }}/financials/documents
    ?file_format=csv
    &limit=all
    &status=posted
    &statement_end_date=2026-10-26
    &additional_fields=true
    &client_id=AmexAPI
    &account_key={{ amex-account-key }}
Cookie: {{ amex-cookie }}
